SY_TALK("7FZDGHwcknU",[[0,["I'm a general practitioner,","what's here I think you call a family physician."]],[5,["I work within the NHS,","I've been doing this work for about ten years."]],[11,["If I could just pick up on a few","of Dr. Patrick's remarks"]],[14,["about the type of patients we see","and who may benefit from complementary therapies."]],[24,["The most difficult part of my work","is dealing with people with chronic illnesses,"]],[31,["chronic distress whether it comes","from physical, psychological or social problems."]],[38,["Those are the patients","that really pose the difficulties."]],[42,["And those are the people that maybe&nbsp;"]],[45,["are going to benefit most&nbsp;","from non-drug approaches."]],[54,["I've been interested in Sahaja Yoga","myself for about twenty years."]],[59,["I'm mainly going to be talking about","the research being carried out into Sahaja Yoga."]],[66,["But if you look through the literature","about yoga and meditation in general,"]],[71,["it's surprising how many illnesses,","how many different conditions you'll find"]],[76,["where there are published studies."]],[79,["Just to run through a partial list,","there's hypertension, coronary artery disease,"]],[85,["heart failure, asthma, osteoarthritis,","diabetes, epilepsy, migraine,"]],[92,["anxiety, depression, stress,","chemical dependency"]],[97,["and obsessive-compulsive disorder."]],[101,["In the US, you now have more patients","consulting complementary practitioners"]],[107,["than consulting conventional doctors,","and we're not far behind in Britain."]],[118,["I myself have been interested","in Sahaja Yoga for twenty years"]],[121,["and there are quite a number of doctors","who have been practising for that length of time."]],[126,["When I first came in, I was quite sceptical","about the benefits to health, to myself."]],[135,["But what really intrigued me","were my own experiences."]],[142,["If I could have the first slide, please?"]],[147,["This is a diagrammatic representation","of what we call the subtle system."]],[154,["This is mainly what Shri Mataji","is going to talk about when she arrives."]],[159,["So I won't discuss it in any detail,","but I myself have experiences"]],[166,["which relate to this system."]],[169,["The other thing which struck me","and various colleagues"]],[172,["was how many people practising yoga","would come up to us without any prompting"]],[178,["and say that their health","had benefited in various ways."]],[181,["So I decided to undertake","a questionnaire survey."]],[186,["I distributed questionnaires","amongst the practitioners,"]],[189,["asking them to report whether","they felt their health had improved or not."]],[199,["And these are the results."]],[202,["Basically, those people with health index","4 or 5 reported their health had improved."]],[210,["The message of this slide is that in general,","the longer people had been practising,"]],[215,["the more they felt","their health had improved."]],[220,["The sorts of illnesses people described","were not major life-threatening conditions,"]],[228,["but things like chronic musculoskeletal problems,","asthma, minor psychological illnesses."]],[246,["So that's the first study."]],[247,["I'm now going to move on to talk about&nbsp;"]],[249,["some research carried out at&nbsp;","the University of New Delhi."]],[254,["Over a number of years under the auspices","of Professor Rai,"]],[258,["who, as Dr. Katchek already mentioned,","was here two years ago and gave a lecture."]],[265,["The first part of this research project","was to look at the physiological effects"]],[268,["of Sahaja Yoga meditation."]],[275,["The message of this slide is that","as people meditate,"]],[280,["galvanic skin resistance increases."]],[285,["And as people learn Sahaja Yoga","over the course of 16 weeks,"]],[294,["the baseline also increases."]],[303,["Blood lactic acid concentrations decrease.","Urinary VMA decreases."]],[316,["Systolic blood pressure decreases."]],[327,["To summarise the physiology, we can say","it's all consistent with the reduction"]],[332,["in sympathetic nervous activity."]],[335,["Other observations were an increase","in alpha activity on the EEG"]],[340,["and in a separate study at McMaster University,","it was shown that beta endorphins rise"]],[346,["whilst people are practising Sahaja Yoga."]],[351,["Moving on now to a number of clinical studies.","First is hypertension."]],[356,["This is a study in which 15 hypertensive patients","were followed up for 16 weeks."]],[364,["The diastolic blood pressure fell","from an average of just over 109 to 86."]],[375,["And the systolic blood pressure fell","from about 170 to 135."]],[381,["This was despite a reduction in medication","amongst the Sahaja Yoga group."]],[387,["So essentially, a group","of uncontrolled hypertensives"]],[391,["where their control was improved","and yet their medication was reduced."]],[397,["In asthma, 9 patients again","followed up for 16 weeks."]],[403,["This slide shows a significant improvement","in lung function"]],[408,["and there was also a reduction","in the number of acute asthma attacks."]],[414,["Again, in most cases there was a reduction","in the medication taken."]],[419,["The third study was on epilepsy.","10 patients followed up for 6 months."]],[427,["Over that 6 months, the average frequency","of attacks was reduced from over 4"]],[435,["to less than 1 attack a month."]],[437,["And 3 patients had stopped","having attacks altogether."]],[451,["So those were all fairly small","and fairly short studies done in India."]],[462,["They've all been replicated in Australia."]],[464,["There's currently a research programme","underway at the University of New South Wales,"]],[469,["and they are moving on to do","larger and more rigorous studies."]],[478,["So that is my presentation."]],[482,["I'm going to ask Dr. Ashish Pradhan to come."]],[487,["He is a clinical pharmacologist&nbsp;"]],[489,["currently working for Bristol&nbsp;","Myers Squibb in Montreal,"]],[493,["where he's the project manager","of health outcomes and economic evaluation."]],[501,["So Dr. Pradhan."]],[596,["---"]],[597,["A very succinct and brief presentation&nbsp;"]],[636,["regarding the studies conducted&nbsp;","so far in Sahaja Yoga."]],[640,["What we are going to try to do","over the next 10 minutes or so"]],[644,["is to take a very quick overview","of the subtle system"]],[650,["to which he alluded,&nbsp;"]],[652,["and about which you shall&nbsp;","be hearing in further detail"]],[661,["from Shri Mataji herself."]],[664,["As a background to what we are going to see","and what you are going to hear from her,"]],[670,["it would be useful to know","what the subtle system is about"]],[676,["and what kind of role it plays in our body."]],[680,["And what kind of effect it would have","on the health outcomes"]],[685,["vis-à-vis the model of Sahaja Yoga."]],[688,["We are also going to see very briefly","some epidemiological evidence"]],[695,["regarding some of the hypotheses."]],[699,["What we can at the present moment regard","as hypotheses, regarding the aetiology"]],[705,["of certain things."]],[709,["The causal relationship, as we would do","in more rigorously controlled studies,"]],[719,["is certainly an issue where you deal with","the whole paradigm of meditation"]],[724,["and its effects on health."]],[727,["What we have tried to do here","is based on what Shri Mataji has been saying"]],[732,["for the past 30 years."]],[735,["We have tried to get from the available&nbsp;"]],[738,["medical literature whatever&nbsp;","evidence may be available"]],[743,["to see if we can find evidence","that conforms to those hypotheses"]],[751,["that Shri Mataji has been talking about","for the past almost three decades."]],[756,["So we shall come to that","in the latter half of the presentation."]],[762,["This is the overview of the presentation."]],[764,["We shall be taking a look","at the subtle system."]],[768,["We shall be looking at what is the aetiology","of disease according to the model of Sahaja Yoga."]],[777,["Then we shall be looking","at the epidemiological evidence"]],[780,["and we shall be concluding","with some key messages."]],[785,["The subtle system is composed","of what are called in Sanskrit as nadis,"]],[791,["or channels of energy,","and they correspond basically"]],[795,["with the autonomic nervous system."]],[800,["Then we have the centres","which are called as chakras"]],[806,["and they correspond","with the nervous plexuses."]],[812,["Finally, we have within each one of us,","situated at the base of the spine,"]],[818,["the triangular bone, a residual dormant energy","which is called as the Kundalini energy."]],[824,["So for the purposes of introduction,","these are the three most important components"]],[830,["that we have to bear in mind."]],[834,["The nadis are predominantly three in number."]],[838,["On the right side we have","what is called as the Ida Nadi,"]],[842,["and this side governs our emotions&nbsp;"]],[845,["and it corresponds to the right&nbsp;","sympathetic nervous system."]],[851,["Then we have the Pingala Nadi&nbsp;"]],[857,["which corresponds to the right&nbsp;","sympathetic nervous system"]],[862,["and that part governs our actions."]],[866,["And then finally we have","the Susumna Nadi"]],[872,["which corresponds to the parasympathetic","nervous system"]],[874,["and this governs our evolution."]],[881,["The chakras are predominantly seven in number;","we shall quickly run through them."]],[885,["At the bottom we have","what is called as the Mooladhara Chakra"]],[888,["which corresponds to the coccygeal plexus."]],[889,["We have the Swadisthana Chakra","which corresponds with the aortic plexus."]],[896,["We have the Manipura Chakra","which corresponds with the celiac plexus."]],[901,["We have the Anahata Chakra","which corresponds with the cardiac plexus."]],[906,["We have the Vishuddhi Chakra","which corresponds with the cervical plexus."]],[910,["The Agnya which corresponds","with the optic chiasma"]],[913,["and the Sahasrara Chakra&nbsp;"]],[915,["which corresponds predominantly&nbsp;","with the limbic system."]],[923,["The Kundalini is a dormant residual energy"]],[927,["and it is the instrument of our Self-realization","through its ascension"]],[933,["and establishment of union, or yoga."]],[938,["Yoga, as Shri Mataji has said,","is basically the union."]],[943,["So when the union takes place,","we say that the real yoga has occurred."]],[949,["In other words, yoga in the classical sense","has got nothing to do with physical postures"]],[958,["or those kinds of calisthenics."]],[961,["But it is an innate internal happening —","it is basically the occurrence of the union."]],[969,["And the Kundalini energy is the instrument","through which this union can take place."]],[977,["So what is Self-realization?"]],[979,["It is the upward ascent of the Kundalini energy","through the certain centres"]],[988,["and establishment of the union","through the All-pervading Divine Power."]],[994,["It manifests — and this is extremely important —","it manifests as the flow of a cool breeze,"]],[1000,["which in Sahaja Yoga we call vibrations,","from the palms of the hands"]],[1006,["and from the top of the head."]],[1012,["Let us take a look at what is","the aetiology of disease in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1017,["But basically we have to define","what is a health state,"]],[1021,["what is positive health","according to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1025,["It can simply be characterised","with three conditions:"]],[1030,["no blockages on the chakras","or on those energy centres,"]],[1036,["a harmonious and steady flow of the cool breeze","through the palms of your hands"]],[1042,["and from the top of the head,"]],[1044,["and a state of complete balance","within the subtle system."]],[1050,["When the internal system within us,","if all the elements within that system"]],[1059,["are in perfect harmony, in perfect balance,","then we say that that is positive health."]],[1066,["So obviously disease would be","a disturbance in this state of balance."]],[1074,["Primarily, the cause of disease","according to Sahaja Yoga"]],[1078,["is an imbalance in the subtle system,","secondary to blockages in the chakra."]],[1083,["This is a very simplistic mechanistic model","of understanding disease through Sahaja Yoga."]],[1093,["Now if we have to understand","what is the causal relationship"]],[1098,["between imbalances","and disease manifestation,"]],[1109,["we have to look at just some of the hypotheses","that Shri Mataji has been saying over the years."]],[1115,["We are going to examine just three","of those hypotheses"]],[1119,["for which we have found","kind of evidence in the literature."]],[1123,["These are not studies","that Sahaja Yoga has conducted."]],[1133,["These are studies which are available","in the literature"]],[1136,["and they were retrieved through the search","of medical databases like Medline."]],[1142,["So basically the first hypothesis","is excessive and inappropriate activity"]],[1152,["of the right sympathetic nervous system,","your Pingala Nadi on the right-hand side,"]],[1159,["leads to a direct effect","on the heart centre."]],[1173,["When we say excessive and inappropriate,","it means that if a person"]],[1178,["is more likely by nature","to get angry pretty quickly,"]],[1182,["or has increased hostility within him,","or has a kind of a domineering nature,"]],[1188,["because the right side","governs our actions."]],[1191,["Yes, we need to perform our actions.","But actions have to be tempered with compassion,"]],[1197,["with the right quantum of emotional input."]],[1201,["Otherwise, it tends to go","into a system of imbalance."]],[1207,["Due to the constraints of time","we cannot go into too many details,"]],[1211,["but this is a simplistic notion","of what excessive right-side activity would mean"]],[1217,["and its effect on the heart centre."]],[1220,["Bearing that in mind, the first study","was the ARIC study published by Williams et al"]],[1227,["in Circulation just a couple of weeks ago."]],[1229,["The investigators were from Duke University","and from Johns Hopkins University."]],[1234,["The design was a prospective study","of 13,000 individuals over five years"]],[1240,["for the association between anger trait","and the risk of cardiovascular events."]],[1249,["So called soft events were incidents of angina,","non-fatal myocardial infarction,"]],[1254,["as compared to heart events","like acute MI and coronary heart disease."]],[1261,["Basically the patients filled out a questionnaire","identifying whether they had an anger trait,"]],[1269,["whether they were more likely","to get angry relative to some other people."]],[1278,["This was part of the atherosclerosis risk&nbsp;"]],[1281,["in community study done&nbsp;","all over the United States."]],[1287,["The results — if we look at the odds ratios","for high versus low anger —"]],[1313,["it is 2.2 and the 95% confidence interval","ranges from 1.36 to 3.5,"]],[1324,["which means if you are a person","who gets angry fast,"]],[1332,["your chance of getting a fatal MI","or a cardiac event"]],[1338,["is between 1 to 3 times&nbsp;"]],[1340,["as compared to someone who&nbsp;","does not have that trait."]],[1346,["For heart events in fact it was 2.6","with a confidence interval of 1.4 to 4.9."]],[1353,["The second study was done in Portugal","by Coelho and colleagues"]],[1357,["and was published in the Journal","of Cardiovascular Risk last year."]],[1361,["It was a case-controlled study","where cases of acute myocardial infarction"]],[1366,["were compared to controls."]],[1371,["Cases of AMI versus controls,","type A behaviour was found"]],[1377,["to be a significant predictor","of acute myocardial infarction,"]],[1381,["and it was also found&nbsp;"]],[1382,["that they had significantly&nbsp;","more depressive symptoms."]],[1386,["What this suggests is that within","a psychosocial construct of an individual"]],[1393,["there was some kind of an imbalance,"]],[1396,["and anger is an emotion predominantly","controlled by the Agnya Chakra"]],[1404,["which, as we said in the hypothesis,","indirectly affects your heart."]],[1411,["Further evidence comes from this American study","published in the American Journal of Epidemiology."]],[1423,["It was a prospective cohort study,","2,200 men over a 9-year period."]],[1428,["The odds ratios: men with hostility scores","in the top quartile"]],[1435,["had an all-cause mortality of 2.3","with a 95% interval of 1.4 to 3.5."]],[1443,["Cardiovascular mortality was 2.7","with a CI of 1 to 5."]],[1448,["The last study in this category","was published in Psychosomatic Medicine"]],[1454,["by Gallagher and colleagues."]],[1459,["This was a random sample cohort study"]],[1461,["and the predictive value of a low anger-out score","for ischaemic heart disease events was 1.7."]],[1471,["Again, it was a statistically significant outcome."]],[1475,["In this study patients had to fill in questions:&nbsp;"]],[1479,["anger in, anger out, do I&nbsp;","express myself when angry."]],[1485,["So basically these studies show us","that out there in the world of epidemiology"]],[1495,["we are beginning to find evidence","which might lend support to the thesis"]],[1504,["that imbalance within us,","especially mediated through anger or hostility,"]],[1511,["may have deleterious effects on cardiac events."]],[1515,["All these studies were done adjusting","for traditional cardiovascular risk factors"]],[1522,["like smoking, hypertension,","obesity and diabetes."]],[1528,["So in a multiple regression model,","even if you adjust for those factors,"]],[1535,["factors like anger and hostility","stand out as independent risk factors"]],[1541,["for cardiovascular disease."]],[1545,["The second is anxiety or insecurity","predisposing women to an increased risk"]],[1551,["of breast cancer."]],[1552,["Shri Mataji has been talking about this","for a number of years."]],[1557,["What we found in one study","published in the Journal of Cancer,"]],[1561,["done in the United Kingdom","by Walter and Collins."]],[1565,["This was a randomised prospective study","of relaxation training"]],[1571,["on response to primary chemotherapy."]],[1574,["This is not incidence of breast cancer.","These are breast cancer patients"]],[1578,["who have been followed up","over a certain period of time."]],[1582,["The primary outcome variable is&nbsp;"]],[1586,["whether or not they are&nbsp;","responding to breast cancer."]],[1590,["The results are quite fascinating."]],[1593,["The HADS score — the hospital anxiety","and depression score —"]],[1597,["both depression and anxiety were significant&nbsp;"]],[1600,["independent predictors of&nbsp;","response to chemotherapy."]],[1604,["Women who had very high scores","of anxiety and depression"]],[1608,["had a higher likelihood of having recurrence,","or failing to respond adequately to chemotherapy."]],[1619,["The last hypothesis is","that, as Shri Mataji explains,"]],[1625,["after marriage the husband and wife","complement each other's state of health."]],[1637,["So if the wife is having some kind of problems,","it does reflect in the husband's health"]],[1644,["and vice versa."]],[1655,["One would say why do you need a study","to prove that?"]],[1657,["But this study was carried out","at the University of Utah"]],[1664,["under experimental conditions","by Brown et al."]],[1670,["It was a randomised controlled trial","of 45 married husbands"]],[1674,["to assess whether the perception","of spousal dominance"]],[1678,["can predict blood pressure reactivity."]],[1683,["The primary outcome was","systolic and diastolic blood pressure."]],[1688,["The results stated that subjects","interacting with the spouse perceived as dominant"]],[1693,["were associated with having","a higher blood pressure."]],[1702,["So what are the key messages?"]],[1704,["Psychosocial factors are emerging&nbsp;"]],[1706,["as significant independent&nbsp;","risk factors of disease."]],[1711,["Sahaja Yoga presents an excellent model","for explaining the role of these risk factors"]],[1717,["in terms of a possible aetiological role."]],[1722,["For example, when we say that there is","some kind of an internal imbalance."]],[1730,["Sahaja Yoga therefore affords&nbsp;","a critical alternative&nbsp;"]],[1733,["for management of these diseases"]],[1736,["through a simple and effortless programme","of correcting these internal imbalances."]],[1742,["How that happens is something&nbsp;","that you will find out&nbsp;"]],[1747,["when Shri Mataji is here&nbsp;","and she will speak to you."]],[1751,["What we want to say is that there is this kind","of evidence out there,"]],[1759,["and though we know that these relationships","might exist between these risk factors"]],[1764,["and heart outcomes,","how do you cure?"]],[1767,["There is no pill that's available,","there is no procedure you can undergo"]],[1774,["in order to have an effect","on these kinds of outcomes."]],[1778,["It basically calls for setting right","your internal imbalances"]],[1782,["and maintaining a state","of positive spiritual health,"]],[1786,["which then has an absolutely salutary effect","on the physical health."]],[1790,["And this is where Sahaja Yoga can help."]],[1793,["Our next speaker is Dr. Brian Wells."]],[1796,["He is a consultant psychiatrist","who specialises in addictive medicine."]],[1805,["He is based in central London","and has an international private practice."]],[1810,["He has lectured at many international conferences.","Dr. Brian Wells, thank you."]],[1836,["---"]],[1837,["Good evening, my name is Brian Wells","as Dr. Pradhan mentioned."]],[1843,["I would like to thank Dr. George Patrick","very much indeed"]],[1846,["for allowing us the opportunity","to come here tonight,"]],[1849,["and also to thank you all very much","for coming."]],[1852,["It's well past the working hours —","Dr. Spiro and I are operating on UK time"]],[1857,["which is well past working hours.","Congratulations for coming."]],[1862,["I know that you are all","eagerly awaiting the arrival of Shri Mataji"]],[1866,["and I can assure you,&nbsp;"]],[1866,["you are not going to be&nbsp;","disappointed when she comes."]],[1870,["We have heard a fair bit about some","of the science around Sahaja Yoga"]],[1875,["and some may be feeling","that this is still very rudimentary."]],[1879,["One of the reasons why we are eager","to present this evening"]],[1882,["is because we want to demonstrate","via properly methodologically sound research"]],[1888,["that the teachings of Shri Mataji","actually have a great deal to offer"]],[1892,["and that they are based","on a scientific basis,"]],[1894,["albeit presented in language","that some of us may not be familiar with."]],[1899,["Some of the words like Kundalini,","chakras, nadis, etc."]],[1903,["may not be familiar to all of us."]],[1905,["They certainly weren't familiar to me","as an allopathic trained doctor"]],[1909,["who in the late 1970s","found himself having to become abstinent"]],[1915,["from alcohol and drugs","and go to 12-step meetings."]],[1918,["I am sure you all know meetings","like Alcoholics Anonymous."]],[1923,["And eventually in 1980 I managed","to get clean, get sober, go to AA,"]],[1932,["did my 90 meetings in 90 days in a row."]],[1936,["As you may know the 12-step fellowships","have a leaning towards spirituality."]],[1944,["They are not religious organisations.","There is quite a lot of talk"]],[1947,["about a power greater than oneself."]],[1950,["As I was progressing through my own recovery","I found myself looking out for things"]],[1958,["that made spirituality more meaningful."]],[1961,["I tried going back to religion,","I tried looking at different types of meditation,"]],[1965,["some of which I was very attracted to","and some of which I wasn't."]],[1973,["Being someone interested in altered states","and chemical experiences,"]],[1980,["what I needed was something","that was experiential."]],[1983,["I found if I sat in a lotus position,","for me, it didn't really do a whole lot."]],[1989,["I was somebody who needed","spectacular experiences."]],[1994,["And in 1982 I met an Indian doctor","who I was working with."]],[2001,["I sat down and had lunch with him","and asked him what he had been doing."]],[2003,["He said he had been travelling in India,","and he had met a meditation teacher."]],[2009,["When he touched her feet,","he was plunged into this state of oneness"]],[2015,["and pure joy and pure knowledge."]],[2017,["He felt this cold wind rushing through him","and he was in a state of pure joy."]],[2025,["To an ex-drug using psychiatrist","looking for spiritual direction,"]],[2031,["it sounded highly interesting."]],[2034,["I said, \"Do you have to be Indian","in order to experience this?\""]],[2039,["So you certainly had to be Indian","in order to understand the terms he was using,"]],[2043,["like Kundalini and chakras."]],[2047,["I have to say that in my own quest","I wasn't really a hippie."]],[2051,["I never got to India.&nbsp;"]],[2053,["I would run out of money by&nbsp;","the time I got to the airport."]],[2059,["I never quite did the Indian trip","which a lot of other people have done."]],[2064,["But I found myself interested.","I liked this guy."]],[2067,["He had something about him","that was appealing."]],[2070,["And I was certainly interested to try this out.","I was trying out all sorts of other things."]],[2074,["Why not this?"]],[2075,["He arranged for a couple of people","to come round to the hospital where I was."]],[2078,["I had to be on duty that night.","They stood behind me."]],[2083,["They had a photograph of Shri Mataji","and lit a candle."]],[2088,["I looked at the photograph","and they stood behind me"]],[2089,["and seemed to wave their arms around&nbsp;"]],[2091,["and mutter things which I&nbsp;","now realise were Sanskrit."]],[2097,["And I sat there waiting to be plunged&nbsp;"]],[2099,["into pure joy and knowledge&nbsp;","and oneness and ecstasy."]],[2106,["It didn't quite happen."]],[2107,["What I did feel was this cold experience","starting at the bottom of my legs,"]],[2112,["working its way up my legs","and stopping at the base of my spine."]],[2117,["I was convinced that there was","a draft coming under the door."]],[2119,["They said, \"No, this is the sort of thing","that people experience.\""]],[2122,["\"People by and large do have some sort of","physical or physiological experience.\""]],[2130,["They then said,","\"Well, it started if you just meditate,"]],[2135,["just looking at the photograph,&nbsp;"]],[2136,["using a candle and achieving&nbsp;","a state of thoughtlessness."]],[2140,["This will just happen for you.","You don't have to do anything.\""]],[2147,["They left me with the photograph","and with the candle."]],[2149,["I have to say I was a little disappointed."]],[2151,["I was hoping for a thunderbolt","to come through the window"]],[2154,["and enlighten me","with oneness with God."]],[2157,["That hadn't happened."]],[2159,["But after they had gone,","I did know that something had happened."]],[2164,["It was something that was totally free.","Nobody had asked me for any money."]],[2169,["It was also something that I knew","in my heart was perfectly safe."]],[2173,["This was not going to harm me."]],[2174,["There was no question I had to wear funny clothes","or eat strange food"]],[2178,["or do anything","that I felt uncomfortable with."]],[2181,["The people who had come around to see me,","they were working."]],[2184,["They'd come around after work.&nbsp;"]],[2187,["One was a computer expert&nbsp;","and the other was his wife."]],[2190,["There was nothing odd about them.","They didn't have weird beads on or anything."]],[2195,["So I felt completely relaxed."]],[2197,["After they'd gone, I became aware","of this —"]],[2200,["it was as though it was a bubble of air","that was following me around,"]],[2203,["sitting on top of my head","and following me around wherever I was."]],[2207,["I was also aware that my visual perception","had changed slightly."]],[2211,["I remember looking at the on-call room I was in.&nbsp;"]],[2214,["It had a white porcelain sink&nbsp;","with a bar of green soap."]],[2218,["It slightly stood out.&nbsp;"]],[2224,["It was as though I'd taken&nbsp;","a small dose of mescaline."]],[2227,["I was aware that something odd,","but something very good, had happened."]],[2233,["And I was on call in this busy hospital.","I went to sleep and just slept."]],[2238,["My pager didn't go off.","I wasn't disturbed."]],[2240,["I woke up the next morning","and I felt very relaxed indeed."]],[2243,["The next day I had to run around London","doing all sorts of things."]],[2247,["What I found was really quite odd.","This may sound a little cosmic."]],[2251,["It may sound as though","I need a little anti-psychotic medication."]],[2256,["But this is what happened."]],[2258,["Whenever I drove anywhere,","the lights seemed to be green. I just flowed."]],[2264,["I had to go on the underground","in London."]],[2267,["I just seemed to walk in.","There wasn't a line to buy a ticket."]],[2270,["I'd buy the ticket.","The train would come in."]],[2272,["The doors were open.","I'd get on the train and go."]],[2274,["Instead of waiting in line","and fighting through London,"]],[2277,["I seemed to be in touch","with some sort of synchronicity."]],[2281,["Things were just flowing and effortless."]],[2285,["I was very conscious that this was unusual."]],[2289,["It was a strange experience for me,","because I was used to having a hassle"]],[2294,["and having to fight my way through London","to make things happen."]],[2303,["I think we'll just pause for one second","because Shri Mataji is here"]],[2307,["and the stage is a bit dark","so she needs to lead the way over to the stage."]],[2311,["So, I'm just going to stop","and then when she's seated I'll carry on."]],[2328,["This cool business that was referred to","by the previous speakers,"]],[2333,["it just seemed to flow","and it made me calm down."]],[2336,["It worked very well in conjunction","with my 12-step programme."]],[2340,["What I was impressed with","was that there was no money involved."]],[2344,["I didn't have to do anything strange.","I could carry on working as a doctor"]],[2347,["in a busy Western city,"]],[2350,["if I just practised this meditation","as was gently suggested to me,"]],[2354,["and did little things to help myself,","such as put my feet in warm water in the evenings."]],[2360,["That felt pretty strange,&nbsp;"]],[2361,["sitting with my feet in a&nbsp;","bucket of warm salted water."]],[2364,["But actually it made me feel a lot better."]],[2367,["For me, what I really liked about it","was that this was experiential."]],[2372,["It wasn't some academic process.","I didn't have to learn Sanskrit."]],[2378,["I didn't have to do anything other than just","experience what was being suggested."]],[2384,["And I gradually began to meet Shri Mataji","and go to meetings"]],[2389,["where there were large numbers of people."]],[2391,["What really struck me about this","is that when there are large numbers of people"]],[2396,["all actually utilising this energy,","the whole thing becomes a very powerful experience"]],[2402,["because there are energies involved","that Shri Mataji will describe."]],[2406,["When there are groups of people doing it together","there is a collective accumulation of energy"]],[2411,["and the whole thing","becomes extremely powerful."]],[2413,["So I went to a large meeting quite early on"]],[2415,["and I came away after a couple of days","of meditation and dance programmes"]],[2423,["and theatre and things that were put on.","It was very joyful."]],[2426,["It wasn't the sort of intense","\"let's all sit down and meditate for 24 hours\""]],[2431,["experiential stuff","that I had kind of ventured into previously."]],[2437,["It was all very joyful,"]],[2439,["and the thing that struck me was that","Shri Mataji herself is full of joy."]],[2443,["She would be describing very complex processes","and there would be laughing and a joyfulness"]],[2449,["and an innocence and an almost childlike state","that people seemed to be in,"]],[2455,["as well as this extremely powerful experience","of the meditation."]],[2459,["And what that meant for me was,","when I sat down after one of these meetings,"]],[2463,["I just wasn't thinking.","I felt totally calm, completely relaxed."]],[2467,["And when I did think,","every thought I had was spot on."]],[2472,["It was pure.","I knew it was accurate."]],[2475,["I knew exactly what was going on","with my patients"]],[2478,["and I just had this confidence","that when I was feeling like this —"]],[2481,["which wasn't the whole time;","it did involve doing some work"]],[2485,["to achieve this state —","but when I was in that calm state,"]],[2491,["I knew that every thought I was having","was some form of pure knowledge."]],[2495,["It was quite extraordinary."]],[2498,["This all happened to me about 18 years ago","and since then things have evolved."]],[2502,["I now use Sahaja Yoga","as part of my practice."]],[2505,["I work a lot with addicts and alcoholics."]],[2507,["We find an awful lot of people","get involved in Sahaja Yoga"]],[2510,["and their desire to use drugs,","to smoke cigarettes, to drink alcohol"]],[2513,["simply melts away."]],[2515,["We don't do intensive counselling.","We don't give them detoxes."]],[2519,["Some people need to go away and have detoxes,","and when they come back"]],[2522,["they find that the state of well-being","and the flow of energy,"]],[2531,["particularly when it's done collectively,&nbsp;"]],[2533,["just seems to lead people&nbsp;","into a state of well-being"]],[2537,["and leads them into a pathway","that seems to be in their own interest."]],[2543,["So I found that my career","has come together."]],[2546,["Life makes much more sense."]],[2547,["It absolutely complements","everything I was heading towards anyway."]],[2552,["It's helped with things like","one's value system."]],[2556,["One suddenly discovers that","driving around in fast cars"]],[2560,["doesn't seem to matter quite so much&nbsp;"]],[2562,["when this is there as a way&nbsp;","of spending one's evening."]],[2566,["So hassling around and wheeling and dealing","just didn't seem to make a whole lot of sense."]],[2570,["So for me, and for a lot of the patients","that I've treated subsequently,"]],[2575,["I'm in no doubt that Sahaja Yoga","is based on a scientific basis"]],[2580,["and it does need to be researched,","and we need a lot more data"]],[2584,["than we're able to present tonight."]],[2586,["It's an experiential process.","It's not academic."]],[2589,["We actually feel physiological sensations.","We feel energy shifting around in our body,"]],[2598,["and hopefully our technology will allow us","to experience some of that this evening."]],[2603,["Sahaja Yoga is a complete formula","both for prevention of illness,"]],[2608,["for the diagnosis of illness","and for the treatment of illness."]],[2613,["It's also entirely free,&nbsp;"]],[2615,["and there are other forms&nbsp;","of meditation that aren't."]],[2617,["There are other forms of meditation and healing","where people are making a lot of money"]],[2620,["out of traditional spiritual techniques."]],[2625,["And for me, being free","and being something that wasn't forced on me,"]],[2630,["being something that's natural,","gentle and joyful is important."]],[2635,["So ladies and gentlemen,","I now like to introduce"]],[2638,["the teacher of Sahaja Yoga,","the founder of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2641,["the person who has evolved","and developed this form of meditation."]],[2647,["I know you're all very pleased to welcome","Shri Mataji Nirmala Devi,"]],[2652,["who is here with us tonight."]],[2678,["---"]],[2679,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[2688,["At the very outset, I would like to thank","the National Institute of Health"]],[2697,["for inviting Me to speak to you people","about Sahaja Yoga."]],[2707,["Today, I'm going to tell you","the secrets of medicine."]],[2713,["So far whatever we have known","in the medical colleges,"]],[2721,["there is something beyond it","which we should know"]],[2725,["and utilise our knowledge for","a great deal of advantage."]],[2741,["'Sahaja': 'saha' means 'with'","and 'ja' is 'born'."]],[2742,["With you is born this right","to become Self-realized."]],[2751,["Yoga is the union","with the Divine Power."]],[2755,["We have heard about Divine Power","in all the books and scriptures,"]],[2759,["but we have never experienced it.","We don't know if it really existed or not."]],[2766,["But the time has come","for us to experience that."]],[2773,["Also in the medical science we know quite","a lot about sympathetic nervous systems."]],[2780,["But we don't know much","about the parasympathetic and its control."]],[2786,["The secret I'm going to tell you is","how to control your parasympathetic system."]],[2805,["It controls and balances all the activity","of the sympathetic."]],[2815,["If I say there is a power placed&nbsp;"]],[2819,["in our triangular bone,&nbsp;","which is called the sacrum,"]],[2826,["you may doubt it."]],[2828,["But this triangular bone is called sacrum —","it's a sacred bone."]],[2833,["That means the Greeks knew about it,","that it's a sacred bone."]],[2837,["In this bone is placed, in three and a half coils,","that is also mathematical,"]],[2843,["three and a half coils,","a power which is made of many threads,"]],[2850,["and which is the one","we call for our ascent,"]],[2858,["for our last breakthrough."]],[2863,["After human awareness, if we had achieved","everything in our evolution,"]],[2869,["there would have been","not all these problems."]],[2872,["So many problems exist —","on individual level, on collective level."]],[2880,["Why these problems should be there","if we are really fully evolved?"]],[2884,["But we are not."]],[2887,["There is something that has to be happening,","and for that our Creator Himself"]],[2892,["has placed this power","in our triangular bone."]],[2896,["Now you need not take my talk as granted,","but you should experiment."]],[2905,["As honest people, you must experiment","and see for yourself"]],[2909,["if there is this power or not,","if it works or not, does it ascend or not?"]],[2918,["It's absolutely scientific.","Absolutely scientific."]],[2923,["And once you enter into that arena","of secret science,"]],[2930,["then you'll be amazed","that there is so much to be known about ourselves."]],[2935,["All the scriptures have said","that you should know yourself."]],[2940,["For us, it is some separate subject,","not for doctors —"]],[2947,["some sort of a religious subject","that we should know ourselves."]],[2960,["But now, we are going towards unity."]],[2964,["Unity as a human being,","unity as all the religions, all the world."]],[2973,["How do we do that?"]],[2975,["Is there any way of connecting you","to that area of Divine Power"]],[2982,["by which you all become one?"]],[2999,["The new future medical science","has to understand what is parasympathetic,"]],[3009,["what is this Kundalini I am talking about,","what is the function of this Kundalini,"]],[3015,["how it works."]],[3017,["Now it is like a primule in a seed","which sprouts and then grows into a tree."]],[3028,["Firstly, whatever is your seeking —","if you have not known yourself,"]],[3032,["seeking may go on and is going on","in this country like a mad race."]],[3039,["All your seeking must come to an end,","otherwise, it has no meaning."]],[3043,["Waste of life, waste of energy.","It's a very, very simple thing."]],[3054,["Within you lies this power,","whatever may be your colour,"]],[3060,["whatever may be your nationality,","your religion or whatever,"]],[3063,["as long as you are a human being,","this Kundalini is there,"]],[3067,["quite ready to be ascending."]],[3071,["It ascends automatically,","just like a seed has a primule which ascends."]],[3078,["You don't do anything.","You don't have to stand on your head."]],[3082,["It is there.","'Sahaj' also means spontaneous."]],[3085,["It works out spontaneously."]],[3087,["You all have this power within you","and only thing you have to do"]],[3091,["is experience this."]],[3093,["This rises, this power rises,","passes through six centres,"]],[3101,["I think they have shown them here,"]],[3103,["and pierces through your fontanel bone area,","which you know what it is, I need not tell you."]],[3108,["And then pierces through and becomes one","with this All-pervading Power."]],[3116,["As this instrument is connected,","you also get connected."]],[3122,["Without connection this has no meaning."]],[3125,["In the same way we do have no meaning,","we are going here, there, there, there."]],[3130,["But we are not yet knowing the truth,","and the truth is"]],[3134,["that you are all going to be the Spirit."]],[3139,["Now here we come very close","to spirituality and to the eternal."]],[3144,["Not to be afraid of it.","It is a part of us."]],[3159,["Of course it is not mentioned","in anatomy or in any one of the books,"]],[3165,["but it is a fact.","You have to see for yourself."]],[3169,["Don't deny because it was not in your books,","but try to see for yourself if it is so."]],[3179,["Because how beneficial it is."]],[3182,["First of all, all these centres","are responsible for your physical,"]],[3188,["mental, emotional","and spiritual beings."]],[3212,["Then the right side is the knowledge","of the body and also the mental self,"]],[3224,["which is also not good.","What you know is outside, superficial."]],[3230,["For that, what you have to do is first of all","get your Realisation."]],[3235,["That, at least, you should have."]],[3237,["Nothing happens to you and there is","nothing to be frightened about it."]],[3242,["There is nothing to doubt about it."]],[3244,["You all have to have your Self-realization —","that is the Self-knowledge."]],[3249,["Once you have your Self-knowledge,","you know all about your chakras."]],[3253,["On your fingertips you can feel","what's the problem with you,"]],[3257,["what's the problem of another person."]],[3259,["For example, somebody has cancer."]],[3262,["Now they have to go through","such a lot of treatment."]],[3272,["But it's only on your fingertips you can say","what disease the person has."]],[3278,["On the fingertips."]],[3280,["Because you are entitled, you are empowered."]],[3283,["But first raise your powers","and become that —"]],[3287,["and I'm talking about becoming","and nothing else."]],[3291,["Unless and until you become that,","you won't understand"]],[3295,["what is the gift of the Divine to us."]],[3300,["Once this Kundalini rises,","she enlightens all the centres."]],[3306,["She integrates all the centres."]],[3310,["Apart from that,","she looks after all these centres."]],[3314,["For example, I will give you","a case of cancer."]],[3321,["Now what we know about cancer","is different doctors for different things."]],[3329,["But it's very simple."]],[3335,["You have the left side and right side","of the sympathetic nervous system."]],[3346,["Now I don't know in medicine","how far they have gone,"]],[3348,["but when I studied,","they thought both are just the same."]],[3351,["They are not.","They are two different systems."]],[3355,["One works for the other,","but in a way it is the opposite."]],[3360,["So it's complementary."]],[3362,["I'll show you now.","Supposing in my hand — I'll show you."]],[3365,["This is one centre from the right side,","another centre from the left side,"]],[3370,["and you put them together.","Now this is the spinal cord, say for example."]],[3375,["Now when you work very hard,","you are working your right sympathetic very much"]],[3383,["and you are exhausting your energy","in the centre, whatever it is."]],[3388,["Suddenly your left side just breaks. Why?"]],[3394,["Maybe some shock,","maybe some accident,"]],[3397,["maybe something due to sickness.","It breaks."]],[3400,["It breaks means it has no connection","with the centre."]],[3405,["That means it is on its own.","That's how a malignant cell starts."]],[3410,["Very simple as that."]],[3412,["Now supposing by any chance","you could raise the Kundalini"]],[3418,["and push it through both these ends,","then they can look after."]],[3424,["That's how cancer can be cured."]],[3426,["Of course, Sahaja Yoga has cured cancer.","All kinds of cancers it has cured."]],[3431,["But we don't want to become doctors, you see.","We don't want to do the doctor's job."]],[3438,["But we can tell you","how you can cure so many people."]],[3451,["So because in a short time","I can't tell you everything,"]],[3460,["let me tell about one chakra."]],[3460,["It's the Swadisthana — they'll show you.","It's the second chakra in you."]],[3463,["A chakra is a centre — a subtle centre","which comes out of your third centre,"]],[3469,["that we call as Nabhi chakra."]],[3472,["And it starts moving like a lotus all over."]],[3478,["This is the one which looks after","all the organs in the stomach."]],[3485,["This chakra is a subtle one."]],[3487,["Of course you may not see it in dissection,","but it is there."]],[3491,["Now when it starts moving like this,","what happens is that you get too much on one side."]],[3502,["Supposing you are working very hard,&nbsp;"]],[3504,["then it has to work too hard&nbsp;","if you are thinking too much."]],[3509,["We never think how our brain is given energy,","from where does it get energy."]],[3516,["It is through this centre","that our brain gets the energy."]],[3519,["The grey cells get the energy","from this centre."]],[3527,["Now this centre is working very hard","when we start thinking too much."]],[3533,["People who think, think, think, think —","what happens is"]],[3546,["this Swadisthana chakra becomes attentive","only to the brain."]],[3551,["But it also looks after your liver.","It looks after the pancreas."]],[3560,["It looks after your spleen, kidneys","and also the lower intestines."]],[3568,["That's the job","this one centre has to do."]],[3572,["Now when you think too much,","the first thing that can happen"]],[3575,["is something goes wrong","with your liver."]],[3582,["The liver, as you know,","is to take out all the heat of the body"]],[3589,["and deliver it into the circulation of blood."]],[3596,["Now if that heat accumulates","it cannot do it, because the liver is failing."]],[3602,["As a result this heat starts moving upward."]],[3606,["Now this is not in the medical books,","but I am just telling."]],[3609,["It starts moving upward."]],[3611,["According to us, there is a centre","we call the right heart —"]],[3616,["a very important centre."]],[3619,["There are three hearts:","left heart, right heart, centre of the heart."]],[3623,["The right heart gets affected","and you can get asthma."]],[3630,["Asthma is absolutely curable,","100% curable."]],[3636,["No doubt, but you have to take to Sahaja Yoga.","That's all."]],[3641,["Then this heat moves from here","and goes to the heart."]],[3645,["When a boy is young,","twenty-one or twenty-two years of age,"]],[3649,["he is playing tennis","and also drinking too much,"]],[3653,["then what happens is his liver","goes out completely,"]],[3658,["and maybe he gets such a massive heart attack","that it is fatal."]],[3665,["But this process goes on and sometimes","people get a massive heart attack later on."]],[3672,["So this is the heat process","which goes from here and moves to the pancreas."]],[3683,["You get the pancreas affected,","you get diabetes."]],[3688,["Diabetes is also curable."]],[3694,["Then it moves down to the kidneys","and the kidneys stop."]],[3702,["One chakra!"]],[3705,["Then heat also, as I told,","goes to the spleen."]],[3709,["If the heat goes to the spleen,","only then you get what we call blood cancer."]],[3716,["I shouldn't say, but we have cured","many blood cancer patients."]],[3721,["Mostly architects and chartered accountants","get this blood cancer."]],[3731,["They are cured.","For the last ten years they are living well."]],[3787,["So it's a very fast happening.","I call it a 'jet Kundalini' in modern times."]],[3794,["And it really works.","It's surprising."]],[3797,["Now this happening of one centre is so important."]],[3804,["There are so many diseases which can be cured","if you can look after these centres."]],[3812,["Except for two."]],[3814,["One is AIDS.","Because they can be cured,"]],[3828,["but they are extremely arrogant","and think they are doing a martyrdom."]],[3834,["How can you talk to them?","It's a big problem like that."]],[3841,["Then another is Alzheimer's.","That's another disease you cannot attend to."]],[3849,["Because this comes to people","who have been like Hitlers in their lifetime —"]],[3854,["arrogant, very aggressive."]],[3858,["These people, when they get this disease,","become even worse."]],[3861,["They may even abuse you.","They can't get up and hit you,"]],[3866,["but they will say everything","that upsets others."]],[3870,["So you give up your hopes about them.","Not that they cannot be cured,"]],[3878,["but it's a little too much","to attend to them."]],[3884,["I tried with three people","then I gave it up."]],[3888,["When they started abusing Me&nbsp;"]],[3892,["I was surprised they couldn't&nbsp;","receive any vibrations."]],[3896,["So I said, \"This cannot work out\"."]],[3898,["So one has to be humble about it."]],[3901,["If you think you have known everything,","it won't work out."]],[3906,["Another thing, you have to be","extremely honest."]],[3909,["You have to be honest to yourself","and honest to the knowledge of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3916,["It's all for you, absolutely free.","It's the best that can happen."]],[3921,["Now I was told that in this institution","you have a lot of research happening."]],[3926,["I would love you people","to do this research on Sahaja Yoga."]],[3930,["All of you."]],[3931,["All the rest of the gimmicks people have done —","they were not at all scientific, in no way."]],[3938,["For this, you don't have to do much research,"]],[3942,["because you raise the Kundalini","of one person and you will see the results."]],[3946,["It's a tremendous power within you."]],[3949,["But we don't know our value."]],[3951,["That's what they said:","\"You should know your Self.\""]],[3953,["We don't know what we have,","what powers we have, what we can do."]],[3960,["Not through book knowledge,","but through the knowledge of the Divine."]],[3964,["So when we come to that,","we understand that spirituality and good health,"]],[3972,["everything is to be proved."]],[3974,["So as a result,","what do you get?"]],[3976,["On your fingertips, you can feel the centres."]],[3981,["Five, six and seven","on the left sympathetic."]],[3986,["Five, six and seven","on the right sympathetic."]],[3987,["You can feel it,","where is the problem."]],[3990,["Then no need to take tests —","on the fingertips you can see where the problem is"]],[3997,["and what should be attended to."]],[3999,["It's a simple method of doing it."]],[4019,["Like so many people have suggested","and have written books"]],[4023,["that if the Kundalini rises,","then this problem comes and that."]],[4027,["Nothing of the kind."]],[4028,["Last thirty years I have been doing this.","I have not seen one person anything&nbsp;&nbsp;"]],[4034,["happening to him."]],[4035,["Never, never."]],[4036,["So it is for you just to see,","spend at the most one month."]],[4043,["And you will be amazed.","You will be masters."]],[4046,["Because it's your own power.","It is not somebody else's power."]],[4051,["It's your own power."]],[4053,["Only thing — you should have&nbsp;"]],[4054,["the full knowledge about the&nbsp;","secret science of medicine."]],[4062,["Because with this we have therapy."]],[4065,["Medicine is for curing people and health.","Then this is the best, easiest way."]],[4071,["But that doesn't mean you discard."]],[4072,["Because you are much more knowledgeable about it,","you know what the problem is."]],[4077,["With the symptoms also you can say","and you can verify. Very easily."]],[4083,["Supposing you put your hands to something","and you feel that person is a psychological case."]],[4092,["You find out, you verify."]],[4094,["And psychological cases","are completely cured in Sahaja Yoga."]],[4099,["There is one patient here","who was with you."]],[4103,["Only, I think two years back I met him.","And today he is a cured man."]],[4109,["Psychology is very difficult,","I must say, I'm sorry."]],[4113,["But they think it's very hard to cure."]],[4119,["Also, medically affected people","can also be very cured."]],[4123,["First, you must become the masters."]],[4126,["You must have the whole powers within."]],[4128,["And then you work it out,","and you will be amazed"]],[4132,["what powers you have,","how much you can do to help this world."]],[4137,["Apart from that, the best thing&nbsp;"]],[4140,["that happens is a person&nbsp;","gets completely transformed."]],[4144,["I feel, I have written also in my book,","that in the genes we have a phosphorus."]],[4152,["And if a person is dry, less water,","this phosphorus explodes"]],[4157,["and you get into tempers."]],[4160,["Getting into tempers is not your doing —","it's just this phosphorus working out the heat."]],[4199,["So you get your experience.","Then you get your peace."]],[4203,["How to get your peace?"]],[4204,["It's very simple that our style is","we see anything, we react."]],[4213,["I see this top table, I react.","I see people, I react."]],[4219,["But with Kundalini rising, it stops."]],[4222,["How? Because a thought arises, falls down,","and a thought arises, falls down."]],[4229,["It's a continuous thing and we are mostly","jumping on the cusps of these thoughts."]],[4235,["Now when the Kundalini rises,","she elongates those thoughts."]],[4241,["There is a space in between —","it's called in Sanskrit, the 'villamba'."]],[4245,["We can call it pause."]],[4247,["And when your mind stops like that,","you become thoughtlessly aware."]],[4253,["You are thoughtless","but you are extremely aware,"]],[4257,["and you reach the witness state."]],[4259,["You see everything as a witness.","Just as a witness."]],[4263,["Say for example, I see a beautiful carpet."]],[4267,["I am very much enamoured and I react:","\"Oh my God, what a good carpet!"]],[4274,["How much it must have cost?","Where can I get it?\""]],[4277,["Supposing it's mine,","then I am too worried:"]],[4279,["\"I have not yet registered it","or insured it, so there is a problem.\""]],[4283,["But supposing I am a Realised soul,","then I just watch it."]],[4289,["I watch it silently and enjoy","all the art that is put into it."]],[4295,["That's how you learn how to enjoy art."]],[4300,["In Sahaja Yoga, I've known people","who were chartered accountants"]],[4303,["who never knew anything","about music or poetry"]],[4306,["and have become very great poets."]],[4310,["Somebody who never used to sing","has started singing."]],[4312,["So many things have happened."]],[4314,["Apart from that, anything —","I must tell in this country — that you prosper."]],[4322,["Because your awareness is so great","that you prosper."]],[4326,["All those Sahaja Yogis","who have come to Sahaja Yoga have prospered."]],[4332,["Not that you are hankering after money.","But money hankers after you."]],[4339,["Why? Because your attention is so deft,","your attention is so pure,"]],[4344,["in the light of the Spirit,","your attention knows"]],[4349,["what is destructive for you,","what is constructive for you."]],[4352,["For example, somebody gets the money","and goes on wasting on this and that,"]],[4357,["getting all the bad qualities","that are not needed for body or mind."]],[4362,["But supposing he is a Realised soul,","he gets the money."]],[4369,["He says, \"It's there for some good purpose.\"","And that's how he works it out."]],[4375,["So the prosperity comes, and the joy."]],[4381,["Joy is singular.","It is not happiness or unhappiness."]],[4386,["If you feel joyous, you feel so joyous","and happy and you don't hurt anybody."]],[4396,["You just enjoy your compassion,","your love, your confidence."]],[4401,["So this is what, when we were students,","we used to think:"]],[4405,["for expression of our love,","we have become a doctor."]],[4409,["For our compassion,","we have become a doctor."]],[4411,["But now the ideology has changed."]],[4415,["You enjoy your work."]],[4418,["I mean, I'm not paying any money","to these doctors,"]],[4420,["neither are they trying","to get money from the patients."]],[4424,["But the enjoyment of curing is so great —","much greater than all the wealth of the world."]],[4431,["And that's how you get it.","But you don't become poor."]],[4434,["There are so many ways you are helped,","because this Divine Power is all-pervading."]],[4459,["That's how you understand","how to have your beautiful family,"]],[4463,["how to have your beautiful","relationships with each other,"]],[4467,["how to lead a very beautiful life","and make a beautiful country."]],[4474,["Such people are needed today."]],[4477,["Such happy, joyous, peaceful","and loving people we need."]],[4485,["And that you get —","for that you don't have to suffer in any way."]],[4489,["You don't have to suffer.","You enjoy."]],[4492,["For curing others, you don't suffer.","You really enjoy every bit of it."]],[4497,["So I wish you all the best of luck."]],[4500,["Please, if you want to have Self-realization,","we'll work it out today."]],[4507,["But that's not the end of it.","You have to attend our centres."]],[4514,["No money in it.","You can't pay any money."]],[4518,["This is one thing you should know."]],[4519,["In this country, they could not accept Me","because I was not taking any money."]],[4523,["Can you believe that?"]],[4523,["They said, \"You have no Rolls Royce?\"","I said, \"No. I have only one car, my husband has.\""]],[4530,["\"You are in the business?\"","\"No, I'm not.\""]],[4531,["\"Then we don't want you.\""]],[4534,["This attitude has to change."]],[4537,["What will you ask for?"]],[4538,["For joy, for happiness,","for doing good to others."]],[4543,["And automatically your heart starts melting","and really you become a wonderful person."]],[4550,["Other problems also get solved."]],[4552,["Like, too much of right side —","because I'm saying, because you are doctors —"]],[4557,["you people all develop right side more","than the left side."]],[4561,["Another thing which is very dangerous","that one can get into"]],[4565,["is the same heat going into your head."]],[4569,["So you can get paraplegia.","It's common. It's very, very common."]],[4578,["But that's not necessary."]],[4580,["Now you know, I'm very old,","much older than all of you."]],[4583,["But one thing is there —","I'm very active and I never feel tired."]],[4591,["It's so enjoyable, the whole thing is,","to talk to people about it."]],[4600,["Moreover, it cannot be forced on you.","It cannot."]],[4605,["You have to ask.","Why? Because this Kundalini is the pure desire."]],[4612,["You know one thing —","that our desires are not satiable."]],[4616,["If they were pure,","there would have been no economics."]],[4619,["Because you want to have one thing,","all right, you get it."]],[4622,["Then you want to have another thing,","you get it. You are never satisfied."]],[4626,["So when this pure desire ascends,","you get the satisfaction."]],[4632,["And that is why you enjoy each and everything.","That's the temperament you should develop."]],[4642,["Beautiful."]],[4642,["Human beings are very beautiful."]],[4645,["I think they are a little bit lost","in the wilderness."]],[4650,["And they have to come back","to understanding of the truth."]],[4655,["Because you get the absolute truth.","Absolute truth."]],[4660,["If any person comes to Me,","I see into my hands."]],[4663,["I say, \"Here it is.\""]],[4665,["You can verify the absolute truth."]],[4668,["Any person who comes and tries to cheat you","as a guru — you can easily find out"]],[4677,["if they're true or not."]],[4680,["Any other thing, whatever you want to know,","it is absolute knowledge that you can get."]],[4687,["We call it 'Gyana' —","it means the power of knowledge"]],[4693,["and the power of absolute knowledge."]],[4695,["On your nervous system you feel it.","It's very, very dynamic."]],[4702,["But you are dynamic."]],[4704,["It's still — it's a sleeping Kundalini."]],[4708,["Let it rise and you will see","how dynamic you are,"]],[4711,["how much you are effective,","how much you can work it out."]],[4715,["Thank you very much again","and I would request people to understand"]],[4723,["that I cannot force it on you.","It has to be of your desire."]],[4727,["And so, I would say,","if you don't want to have your Self-realization,"]],[4733,["then go away."]],[4735,["But it's nothing —","it hardly takes ten&nbsp;&nbsp;"]],[4737,["minutes for you to reach the heavens."]],[4740,["So why not try it?"]],[4764,["---"]],[4765,["I wonder if you could be specific","about what one would expect to see"]],[4775,["if somebody sits."]],[4778,["Does one sit in that position?","Does one say a mantra?"]],[4782,["Does one do physical movement?","Does one close one's eyes?"]],[4789,["I have no idea what you are talking about."]],[4801,["That I will tell you, definitely."]],[4803,["But you don't have to stand on your head,","nothing of the kind."]],[4806,["All right? It's very simple."]],[4807,["Wherever you are sitting, it's all right.","Thank you for asking."]],[4816,["---"]],[4816,["Mataji, what would be the effect","of diet and posture on meditation?"]],[4822,["This you can find out."]],[4831,["Once you have your Realisation,&nbsp;"]],[4833,["you will realize what sort&nbsp;","of a personality you are"]],[4836,["and what sort of food you should have."]],[4845,["Once you get your Realisation,","you yourself will realize"]],[4849,["what kind of food you should take","and what kind of posture you should do."]],[4855,["Certain schools say that the kind of diet","you take — say fruits and natural foods —"]],[4864,["will provide an aid in meditating properly."]],[4868,["Things like meat or wine,","they say, will not work properly."]],[4885,["It's not like that.","It's a very analytical thing."]],[4891,["Say for example, I would say in general,","in India, people should eat meat"]],[4896,["because they are so weak,","their muscles are so weak."]],[4900,["But say in the European countries,","they should eat less meat"]],[4906,["because they are quite muscular,","I think sometimes."]],[4909,["But for a liver patient,","there is another kind of food."]],[4916,["You see, it depends on the personality.","All right?"]],[4936,["---"]],[4937,["My son is autistic","and he has a very low mental IQ."]],[4943,["So how can I treat him?","How can he do the yoga?"]],[4972,["He can be cured.","He can be cured."]],[4985,["Where is your meditation class","and how can we get there?"]],[4988,["No, no, you have to come","and we will see."]],[4990,["We can try","and you don't have to pay anything."]],[4996,["You bring that son there,","your child, and you see for yourself."]],[5044,["---"]],[5044,["She is talking about somebody","who is 29 years of age and he can't even sit."]],[5051,["So I said, \"All right,","you get your Realisation."]],[5054,["You understand","and you can cure him.\""]],[5056,["Also, these people can go and do it."]],[5061,["She can do it herself."]],[5064,["We have no hospital here, nothing."]],[5067,["I wanted one of these doctors","to come and stay here"]],[5072,["and tell you about Sahaja Yoga."]],[5077,["If somebody could be employed or something,","he could come here."]],[5081,["That was my suggestion."]],[5104,["---"]],[5105,["This is about Sahaja Yoga.","So you are dealing with the Kundalini yoga here."]],[5113,["In India and everywhere.","It's not here only."]],[5146,["All right. That's the point for that."]],[5149,["You have to come to our centre."]],[5151,["We have got books.","I have written four books, I think."]],[5156,["And also we have written about medicine.","You can come and get it."]],[5160,["They will help you.","But you have to come there, you see?"]],[5163,["Yes, I will come there.","But is there some flyer?"]],[5168,["Can you let us know","where the yoga centres are here in Maryland?"]],[5177,["That information will be conveyed","to you shortly."]],[5184,["They will do all that","and tell you where things are."]],[5187,["Now, most of them are anxious","to get their Self-realization."]],[5189,["So you get your Self-realization,","and then you go to the centre also."]],[5194,["All right? Thank you."]],[5210,["---"]],[5211,["I have worked with the AIDS patients","that you mentioned"]],[5216,["and they want to come back to the meetings","and they do the meditation themselves."]],[5223,["They have been treating themselves."]],[5233,["All these things you can ask","at the centre."]],[5239,["Why not ask there?"]],[5241,["While people are waiting","to get their Self-realization."]],[5244,["So let's respect that."]],[5247,["We have to respect them,","respect ourselves also."]],[5273,["---"]],[5274,["All right. Now everybody must sit down.","That's important."]],[5279,["You should be relaxed.","Please be seated."]],[5283,["You all should be relaxed."]],[5287,["Now one humble thing I have to ask","is to take out your shoes"]],[5293,["because Mother Earth","will also help you."]],[5353,["Please put both your hands towards Me,","just like this."]],[5357,["Simple like this."]],[5359,["If they are on your lap,","it's also all right."]],[5369,["Whichever way you feel comfortable."]],[5369,["Now, at the very outset,","I have to ask you one thing —"]],[5376,["that you should not feel guilty at all","for anything."]],[5380,["I'm catching this finger,","that means there are people&nbsp;&nbsp;"]],[5383,["who are feeling guilty."]],[5387,["Whatever has happened in the past is past.","It's finished."]],[5391,["And the future doesn't exist.","You have to be in the present."]],[5395,["And so please, don't feel guilty."]],[5397,["If something has been done wrong,","all right, so what?"]],[5402,["At this moment, at least,","you should not be guilty."]],[5405,["It's a wrong thing","to feel guilty and kill yourself."]],[5410,["I don't know why,","in the West they have done nothing wrong."]],[5414,["If they were guilty,","they would have been in jail."]],[5416,["It's a common fashion","to feel guilty also."]],[5420,["Indians will never feel guilty, somehow.","They don't know how to fight to feel guilty."]],[5426,["And then another thing is","that you have to forgive others."]],[5431,["Forgive others."]],[5433,["You may say, \"Mother,","it's very difficult to forgive others.\""]],[5439,["You may say that."]],[5439,["But what I would say logically is,","whether you forgive or not forgive,"]],[5450,["you are doing nothing."]],[5452,["By not forgiving,","only you torture yourself."]],[5456,["So forgive."]],[5458,["Forgive everyone and forgive yourself."]],[5463,["That's a very important thing","and it has such a tremendous power."]],[5467,["So I request you to forgive yourself","and forgive others."]],[5473,["That's all."]],[5474,["If you can do this, it will work out,","and I'm sure it will work out."]],[5484,["Now, how do you forgive?"]],[5486,["Just to say, \"Mother, I forgive everyone.\"","That's all."]],[5487,["\"Mother, I forgive myself.","Mother, I forgive everyone.\""]],[5492,["You can say that."]],[5497,["It's very simple to say."]],[5497,["That's not a mantra or anything,","but it's a very big thing,"]],[5500,["because it opens the centre here,","at the Agnya,"]],[5503,["which is on the crossing","of the optic chiasma, which is very constricted."]],[5507,["And it opens like that."]],[5511,["So just say that,","because the Kundalini has to rise."]],[5514,["That's the main thing."]],[5525,["Now please put your right hand towards Me","and put down your head"]],[5530,["and see for yourself if there's a cool breeze","coming out of your head."]],[5536,["Just see."]],[5536,["Cool or hot breeze coming out","of the fontanel bone area."]],[5541,["Just see for yourself."]],[5542,["You can put your hand up there,","or on the sides, forward, backward,"]],[5548,["anywhere you feel like."]],[5549,["And see for yourself if there's a cool breeze","or hot breeze like vibrations coming out."]],[5556,["It is hot because you have not forgiven yourself","or you have not forgiven others."]],[5563,["This must be the reason."]],[5564,["But let feel that it's coming out of your head —","that is the biggest proof."]],[5570,["Now don't doubt it."]],[5571,["There's no air conditioning in your head","that it is coming out."]],[5575,["People start doubting like that."]],[5576,["So raise it a little bit."]],[5578,["Now raise it.","Not in front."]],[5580,["Take it on the fontanel bone area","which was the soft bone in our childhood."]],[5594,["Now please put the left hand towards Me,","and bend your head"]],[5601,["and see, with the right hand now,","see for yourself"]],[5605,["if there's a cool or a hot breeze","coming out of your head."]],[5619,["Have faith in yourself.","That's the main thing."]],[5622,["You all can get Realisation","and you can become Self-realised also,"]],[5627,["just like Sufis."]],[5631,["Now put your right hand towards Me","and left hand again on the fontanel bone area."]],[5640,["You can move your hand","and see for yourself"]],[5644,["if there's a cool or a hot breeze","coming out of your head."]],[5652,["Now after this, please put both your hands","towards Me like that, and don't think."]],[5666,["Just don't think.","Don't think. Just don't think."]],[5678,["Have your hands fully open like this","and don't think."]],[5693,["All those who have felt cool or hot breeze","on the fingertips, or on the palm,"]],[5704,["or on top of your head,","out of the fontanel bone area,"]],[5712,["please raise your hands."]],[5718,["Oh My God! Thank you very much.","So many of you, wow!"]],[5728,["Now I have a very humble request —","that you must attend the courses in our centres."]],[5734,["Please attend our centre","and try to master this."]],[5739,["You can."]],[5740,["This power that is given you here","is coming out of your fontanel bone area,"]],[5745,["and it is there."]],[5748,["It's so great and works in no time."]],[5751,["So I would request you to please go","to our centre and master it."]],[5757,["And you will see how many wonders you can do,","because you are so powerful."]],[5763,["Again I thank you very much,","all of you and your institute"]],[5768,["which has been so kind to Me."]],[5770,["Thank you."]]]);
